__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.venv/
outputs/
*.npz
*.mp4

# field_store/objects holds the ONLY copy of states that cost GPU-hours, so this
# is a deployment limit rather than a judgement that they are disposable (`*.npz`
# above already catches them; this is here to be found). 7.4 GB does not belong
# in git; see field_store.py PROMOTION for the lfs / release-tarball routes.
# field_store/index.json is NOT ignored and IS tracked, so the repo states what
# is held — 10/10 as of 2026-08-02, when the states were recovered from
# null-worldtube-private. What is MISSING stays derivable from the tracked
# catalog regardless.
# See src/soliton_playground/ehn_lab/field_store.py, RECOVERY and PROMOTION.
field_store/objects/**
!field_store/objects/
!field_store/objects/*/
# The .npz stay out (757 MB each). The run MANIFESTS do not: 10 KB apiece, not
# regenerable, and render_portrait.load_field cannot read a field's box size
# without one. Tracking them is what lets this repo render its own catalog
# without reaching into null-worldtube-private, which is being retired.
!field_store/objects/**/*.manifest.json
!field_store/index.json

# Materialized copies under particles/ are artifacts of `field_store materialize`
# -- the store holds the authoritative one. Field and manifest both stay out.
src/soliton_playground/ehn_lab/particles/*/manifest.json

# Battery run artifacts, reproducible from the engine SHA; not source.
src/soliton_playground/ehn_lab/certificates/
